OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOccasional
OL,6,Fshowers this evening, these most
OL,7,Fwidespread through Moray and western
OL,8,FAberdeenshire. Mainly dry overnight
OL,9,Fwith isolated showers in the west,
OL,10,Fclear skies at times across Aberdeen
OL,11,Fand the east.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FIt will be mainly dry and
OL,14,Fbright with some sunny spells. A
OL,15,Fscattering of showers developing and
OL,16,Fwinds mainly moderate from the west or
OL,17,Fsouthwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
